<title>FRANCE: GAN says chairman not resigning.</title>
<headline>GAN says chairman not resigning.</headline>
<dateline>PARIS 1996-11-19</dateline>
<text>
<p>Jean-Jacques Bonnaud, the chairman of state insurer GAN, is not resigning, a spokeswoman for the company said on Tuesday.</p>
<p>The government called on Monday for his resignation after Finance Minister Jean Arthuis said last week he was scrapping a tender to privatise GAN banking subsidiary CIC and that neither the GAN nor the CIC chairman had helped promote the sell-off.</p>
</text>
